00:10:46.914 --> 00:10:50.088
- You can't replace that and
you can't replace Frank Ocean.

00:10:50.088 --> 00:10:52.820
- [Shahi] You can't replace Common.

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:53.779
- Yeah that's right,

00:10:53.779 --> 00:10:55.520
that's right.
(laughs, applauding)

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:57.393
I know they've got, what do they got?

00:10:57.393 --> 00:11:00.420
You know the thing they did
with Tupac and all those.

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:01.253
- Holograms.

00:11:01.253 --> 00:11:02.600
- Holograms, but

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:04.327
it's nothing like having the real thing.

00:11:04.327 --> 00:11:06.200
