00:11:18.554 --> 00:11:20.970
So, you know, it's funny.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:21.980
Same thing with the internet,

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:23.697
I remember when the internet

00:11:23.697 --> 00:11:27.258
