00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:34.630
a launching company.

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:36.330
I'm a VC, so many things.

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:38.920
I look at this as a
real opportunity for us

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:41.996
