00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:48.610
I don't think there should
be anymore slave labor!

00:12:48.610 --> 00:12:49.690
This is an opportunity.

00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:52.320
Like I was just in
China for the last month

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:55.060
