00:14:56.494 --> 00:14:57.390
- Absolutely.

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:59.620
So at the end of the day, guys,

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.890
the tech industry is taking a lot of fire

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:03.308
