00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:06.640
So,

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:08.249
why is diversity important?

00:15:08.249 --> 00:15:10.260
What does it mean to the future?

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.940
And what opportunities does it bring?

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:14.006
- [Phu] Can I start with this?

00:15:14.006 --> 00:15:14.839
- Yes.

00:15:14.839 --> 00:15:16.800
