00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.790
at every meeting.

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:30.244
And, yes women, join!

00:15:30.244 --> 00:15:32.592
Join the Blockchain!
- [Denise] Yes, yes!

00:15:32.592 --> 00:15:33.462
(applauding)

00:15:33.462 --> 00:15:35.499
WomenInBlockchainFoundation.org

00:15:35.499 --> 00:15:37.542
Join our telegram channel.

00:15:37.542 --> 00:15:38.411
(laughs)

00:15:38.411 --> 00:15:43.200
But it's really important
for us to be diverse

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:45.780
'cause if you think about
it on a technological layer,

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:50.780
like a blockchain having
nodes all around the world,

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:54.810
