00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:53.804
- [Shahi] Well said Phu, well said.

00:16:53.804 --> 00:16:55.758
- And you know,

00:16:55.758 --> 00:16:58.020
this is the world, man.

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:00.019
Everybody has something to offer.

00:17:00.019 --> 00:17:04.660
We just all have something
to give to this world

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:07.677
and Jeff brought up something
when I was talking back there.

00:17:07.677 --> 00:17:09.830
A community that I didn't acknowledge

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:12.360
