00:18:40.251 --> 00:18:42.110
- [Denise] Yes, yes.

00:18:42.110 --> 00:18:44.360
(clapping)

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:46.320
- I think this
- You come from a

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:47.570
